		{"id":"path_277","type":"text","text":"# PATH｜现实落实\n\n规则知道 ≠ 现实可执行。\n\n检查：\nexecutor / tool / endpoint / permission / trigger / runtime / input / output / return_channel\n\n状态：FOUND → ACQUIRED → READABLE → UNDERSTOOD → ADAPTED → EXECUTABLE → AUTOMATABLE → VERIFIED\n\n缺PATH可形成BLOCKER，但PATH状态不能和problem_status混在一起。","x":8400,"y":4300,"width":1200,"height":700,"color":"2"},
