		{"id":"1100000000000015","type":"file","file":"黎黎隆项目/00_总览/L1-L4问题知识/MAIN-15.md","x":-520,"y":840,"width":760,"height":420,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"role_z_bridge_20261007","type":"text","text":"# ROLE_Z_BRIDGE｜角色 L1/L2/L3 双 Canvas 接头\n\n总问题系统只负责总控，不复制角色细节。\n\nG2｜角色稳定 → 三个独立 Z：\n- Z-ROLE-L1｜身份 / 视觉核心锁定\n- Z-ROLE-L2｜多视图 / 身体结构稳定\n- Z-ROLE-L3｜Canon / 世界职责成立\n\n每个 Z 独立挂：local_xn_set / nx_gaps / authority_state / path_state / expected_xn_fit / verified_xn_fit / done_condition\n\n角色侧正本：[[../03_角色/角色库/角色总Canvas.canvas]]\nLinear：674-280\n\n回传：achievement / verified_xn_fit / unresolved_nx / blocker_scope / evidence / done_status\n\n⚠️ L1/L2/L3 不是头像三级 step；H3_READY 只是下游消费资格。","x":-6620,"y":-1180,"width":1500,"height":760,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ctr_c4","type":"group","x":8940,"y":40,"width":4020,"height":3370,"color":"#2da44e","label":"C4 来源考古 · Linear 674-94（无 MAIN 卡，收纳 source/evidence）"},
