		{"id":"z1b_277","type":"text","text":"# Z1-B｜XN规则获取与校准\n\nvolume 74\nREQ / HIGH\n来源 / 覆盖度 / 可靠度 / 有效性 / 校准","x":14400,"y":2300,"width":1000,"height":420,"color":"2"},
