		{"id":"g4","type":"text","text":"G4｜分镜 / 镜头稳定\n\nV10-B｜CHAR-STORYBOARD\n状态：BLOCKED_SOURCE_MISMATCH\n当前指定 thread 只支持纯色角色/小世界视觉发散\n缺真正 event → storyboard / shot decomposition / continuity 成功源","x":-5260,"y":-1700,"width":520,"height":200,"color":"5"},
