		{"id":"m04_c2d1e8f3","type":"text","text":"# MAIN-04｜服装如何由身份、组织与世界观生成\n\n状态：未解决\n缺组织级服装语法和头像到服装的稳定桥接。\r\n知识：[[L1-L4问题知识/MAIN-04|知识卡]]\r\n下钻子问题：8（详见知识卡）","x":-5880,"y":840,"width":820,"height":420,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"g6","type":"text","text":"G6｜资产与版本稳定\n\n状态：SYNC_DEBT_FOUND / RECONCILING\n发现 Linear DONE 与 GitHub Canvas 状态回退\n根因：远端 Canvas 骨架镜像重建后，未完整增量合并此前 Q 子节点状态\n本轮：改为 stable node_id 增量 patch；禁止整图覆盖","x":-3980,"y":-1700,"width":520,"height":320,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"problem_state_v1","type":"text","text":"## Problem State v1｜已冻结\n\n核心字段：\nq_id / parent_goal / problem_statement / problem_depth(D1-D3) / domain / status\nknown / unknown / tried / rejected / current_hypotheses / evidence / source_refs\ncurrent_version / next_decision / done_condition / required_agent\n\nM3：3/3 真实样本完成\n- 头像/角色视觉：Q-CHAR-001.1\n- 流程/资产：Q-ASSET-001\n- 世界观/十元：Q-WORLD-001\n\nM4：3/3 L5/L6 消费测试 PASS\nM5：本地真实落地验收 PASS\nlocal commit: 51825b3b4bea924d956d69dd3b968956e74f861d","x":9200,"y":1300,"width":460,"height":340,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"m03_c2d1e8f3","type":"text","text":"# MAIN-03｜头像→中景/中全景/全身的角色一致性\n\n状态：部分完成｜新增角色认知×四宫格逐格对齐门\n问题：四宫格存在 ≠ 角色认知已对齐；一格漂移也可能污染 H3。\n办法：AG-11 输出 CHARACTER_H3_READY_PACKET，逐格审 identity/cognition/proportion/costume。\n知识：[[L1-L4问题知识/MAIN-03|知识卡]]\n下钻子问题：9\\nH3 关联细节：[[H3视频生产问题.canvas]]","x":-7600,"y":840,"width":820,"height":420,"color":"2"}
